{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Uei8mI5CDY-I6ZOwsVMWlg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:53.738202+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Uei8mI5CDY-I6ZOwsVMWlg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/NGD16Gn1haV08tH5yybiawFlkSOXpKUBuBOe38NfVFPh06Ud3FzU6wLo8HibEwicqLbEhSTEYQpDm2n7tyV9Z0uibm4GmSOVHEaOO7PTW1QMrjo/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haXULTdJGnPBicHDmibV9Ac1caQHrAUdsbeiaOuMTDFlq9cvPavKKvLic0Ej8A7xU5YYrPIpzKWRu3TaibgG7ZOwzZFD5qyyuDicPkuNg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/NGD16Gn1haW8GRRcMDTCibW4FdxMRDJD4Dwkh4odriadnksicWeqgYvHwvOoOIbAq7ksxZTrpeHZ9GMMyFO9vhhiaLvJesMLibHbJ3zK4UV8VRmE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、学院介绍</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>脑和类脑学院由中国医学科学院北京协和医学院、北京市科学技术委员会、中关村科技园区管理委员会、北京脑科学与类脑研究所共同合作建设。学院的建设宗旨为瞄准世界脑科学前沿和国家在脑科学研究领域的战略急需，聚焦于脑认知原理解析、脑重大疾病、神经科学新技术、神经工程等研究方向，打造集科研探索、人才培养与教育创新于一体的国家脑科学科技创新体系核心基地和世界一流的脑科学新型研发机构。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/NGD16Gn1haWDiciaxiclib1dF3hYlCtBTFEzVkuiap7KAERicLmicLzoO9EUTOwaHxS8RQhq8mNu3SKc9c6bE7JMIicgee1ROA9jea4TjbibLBtQwHy0/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、活动简介</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>脑和类脑学院于</span><span><strong><span>即日起至2026年8月23日</span></strong></span><span>期间开通2027年研究生推荐免试线上报名通道，欢迎神经科学、生物科学、基础医学、心理学、认知科学、生物医学工程、计算机、人工智能等相关交叉专业，及有意向投身脑科学领域的在校学生积极报名。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/NGD16Gn1haU1AISPmEXSJmVGhkduLqcialjQ4wibn8x1GNLIWjv1qFic82B4ibbrKazYy3Y2GfpDica2nAYy4usZ46Sqaz9PwUqDJ5W5IrwFKowU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. </span></span></strong><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，热爱祖国，身心健康，遵守法律、法规和学校的规章制度，诚实守信、品行端正；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2. </span></span></strong><span>在目前就读学校取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.</span></span></strong><span> 具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，诚实守信，学风端正；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4.</span></span></strong><span> 英语水平要求：推免直博生要求达到全国大学英语六级考试（CET-6）430分及以上。推免硕士生要求达到全国大学英语四级考试（CET-4）450分及以上或者通过全国大学英语六级考试（CET-6）425分及以上。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/NGD16Gn1haWx0a2xxQZJDJeV3KvM8AViaa6jU68B1t5dCHC2CJlvMH7K0JEXXrSNDgWKzGvJOTB8qEEaR5jCdGBL4m7Juey1Ho7TNw428gH0/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. 网上申请：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>即日起至2026年8月23日17：00</span></span></strong><span>期间通过北京协和医学院夏令营及推免预报名系统</span><strong><span><span>（网址：https://yzbtm.pumc.edu.cn）</span></span></strong><span>进行线上报名，具体注册报名、材料准备等相关要求详见学校通知；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2. 材料审核：</span></span></strong><span>由评审专家委员会对报名材料进行评审，择优确定综合能力测试名单，报名人须自觉保证提供材料的真实性，若发现任何不实情况，立即取消报名及评审资格，综合能力测试名单将在北京脑科学与类脑研究所官网按要求公示；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3. 综合能力测试：</span></span></strong><span>预计于</span><strong><span><span>2026年9月上旬至中旬期间</span></span></strong><span>开展，测试工作安排及后续通知敬请关注北京脑科学与类脑研究所官网人才培养-研究生招生-招生公告模块相关信息</span><strong><span><span>（网址：https://cibr.ac.cn/cibrPersonnel/admissions）</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/NGD16Gn1haW8fibJscEeic4LgtI4pgXmEwRiafIxh1bHL6nZxnh6YfqWbGWhYicygTEDuAGWGJh5AIWaKs4pW3HqKnY2ZT3TCYqbEEmZqDHbeOc/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>相关信息请查询北京脑科学与类脑研究所研究生招生工作常见问题解答</span><span>（网址：https://cibr.ac.cn/detail/cibrPersonneladmissions/5d82d0e8ad2347c1b78bffbbb13c802f）</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>联系人：</span><span>杨老师</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></strong><span>010-81912671</span></p><p><strong><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span></strong><span>cibrstudent-apply@cibr.ac.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/NGD16Gn1haUiblP3T0jOPYibYWaiaDcST1uPQHYT2qNl2qBbvNOxF4a2b32CwKXWD0tI0eSRiaiaStsNu5T1fWAG7lO8OR2uNMY0PuLtG4rM0zIU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"662a7f6e69039d717f250696e3cda17f0bf47c78a81d318f723bfb8b91530bf2","textLength":1081,"sourceSha256":"ef93c49e7cb44effdf42f211be0e30509959602192337da086b6b5d1701b3742","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4cadbba765a3a1bea516","title":"2026年北京协和医学院脑和类脑学院推荐免试预报名工作的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:53.738202+00:00"}
